            "sid": "GEN 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri waan jed'e, Nu ya agarre aka AABBO Waaqi si woliini jiru, tanaafi wonti nu feenu aka wolti kakhanne wold'annuu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka atini waan hamtu nu intolchine, akuma nuleeni waan hamtu si intolchini. Nu sii naane nagayaani si gad'iimne. Amma ya agarre, aka AABBO Waaqi si eebise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaqooni hori qaleefi, nyaatani d'ugani quufani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boriyya diirama wolti kakhatani, nagaya wolti d'aamatani, nagayaani gargari bahani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
